+"""Modular CLI command surface for PLW.
+
+Domain modules (strict acyclic import layering):
+- common: argument parsing, output normalization, error and receipt helpers
+- analysis_cmds: context, transitions, kan, check, steer
+- topology_cmds: topology, mermaid, simplify, angular-anchors
+- ast_cmds: tree-sitter / codesearch-go AST queries
+- agent_cmds: agent, chain, doctor, capability, skill, resolve-target, candidate, semantic
+- memory_cmds: compact/recover/attest output, transition/Q-value memory, lineage, accountability
+- action_cmds: action-lease, action-outcome, action-adapter
+- ui_cmds: ui subcommands, ui-reference, runtime-ui-reference, geometric-impact
+- validation_cmds: validation-* pipeline, postcondition-proof, fullstack-state
+- umbrella_cmds: lease, proof, ledger namespace routers
+- help_text: top-level PLW CLI help surface
+"""
